Chapter: CardPool
  cites CodexMagic chapter Mana
  cites CodexMagic chapter Card

 Card pool: a starter set of templates across all colors and types.
 This is the base pool for season one. Each color has lands,
 creatures at multiple costs, removal, and utility spells.

 We say:

Section: Lands (0-4)

  pool-mountain : CardTemplate
  pool-mountain = make-basic-land 0 "Mountain" Red

  pool-plains : CardTemplate
  pool-plains = make-basic-land 1 "Plains" White

  pool-island : CardTemplate
  pool-island = make-basic-land 2 "Island" Blue

  pool-swamp : CardTemplate
  pool-swamp = make-basic-land 3 "Swamp" Black

  pool-forest : CardTemplate
  pool-forest = make-basic-land 4 "Forest" Green

